## 1. Product, Service & Core Research Question
- **Business Product/Service:** A local weekly meal-prep kitchen offering fresh, portioned meals for weekly pickup or local delivery.
- **Target Workflow:** Weekly Menu Selection & Dietary Filtering (browsing the weekly menu $\rightarrow$ filtering by dietary/macro needs $\rightarrow$ building a 5-to-10 meal box $\rightarrow$ locking in the order before the weekly cutoff).
- **Research Question:** How can a local weekly meal-prep service let customers filter by dietary restrictions and macro goals to build a weekly meal box quickly without menu overwhelm or allergen confusion?

